      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This was something I was wondering about as well since this dropped and the recent revamp of how things are displayed.\n\nI think that giving group owners the choice for their groups to only have certain types of instances open by roles is a safer way to keep groups from being exposed to those not willing to interact with such. Which is part of the reason some groups get banned or taken down. \n\nI myself seek to have my group only open 18+ verified instances. As well I seek to see that requests to join a group to required a verified 18+ account to even allow the request. \n\nIts a bit tiring to manually go over all requests manually.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
