      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{60bc6d5b80af9e6f191344f8|full_name}, Sounds like it would be better to just allow for groups to be content tagged and make the whole group age gated. As an added thing, making all instances by that group automatically be age gated would make sense, and work much better than some obscure role permission.",
